# Exception: this repo's actual hackathon deliverables (small, final,
# `cache: false` in dvc.yaml) ship directly in git so teams have them right
# after cloning, no CDS/MaStR account needed — see PROJECT.md, 2026-09-18.
# Everything else under data/processed/ (in particular _intermediate/,
# rebuilt from data/downloads/) stays git-ignored.
